usage: boundary_doc_check.py [-h] [--doc DOC] [--checker CHECKER]
                             [--self-test]

Check frozen boundary-document drift, recorded receipts, explicit anchor
ranges, and structure; no semantic or AST validation.

options:
  -h, --help         show this help message and exit
  --doc DOC          document path (default: pinned path under the script's
                     repo root)
  --checker CHECKER  delivered checker path (default: pinned path under the
                     script's repo root)
  --self-test        exercise isolated committed inputs and adversarial cases
